[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2462.565, "timestamp": "00:41:02", "text": "薰衣草是蓝色的，对吧？是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2466.372, "timestamp": "00:41:06", "text": "是的。让我查一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2470.828, "timestamp": "00:41:10", "text": "它是蓝色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2472.909, "timestamp": "00:41:12", "text": "是的，它是蓝色的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2476.01, "timestamp": "00:41:16", "text": "是的，这就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2481.511, "timestamp": "00:41:21", "text": "我想，这是一种颜色吧。它……它是一种颜色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2489.188, "timestamp": "00:41:29", "text": "是的。是的。稍等片刻。颜色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2493.627, "timestamp": "00:41:33", "text": "它存在于它自己的王国里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2497.24, "timestamp": "00:41:37", "text": "我猜是吧。啊，是的。这是家族传统。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2501.962, "timestamp": "00:41:41", "text": "我想应该是紫色的那些吧。啊，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2513.522, "timestamp": "00:41:53", "text": "紫色的。嗯，你还记得吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2515.061, "timestamp": "00:41:55", "text": "我们以前经常玩旅行游戏……"}]